#### Bug #11 + #12：重试任务的并发与顺序问题

**修复思路**：使用乐观锁（状态机 CAS）替代先查后改，确保多实例安全。

```java
// EventConsumeFailedRecordRepository.java 新增方法
@Modifying
@Query("UPDATE EventConsumeFailedRecordEntity e SET e.status = :newStatus, e.updateTime = now() " +
       "WHERE e.messageId = :messageId AND e.status = :expectedStatus")
int casUpdateStatus(@Param("messageId") String messageId,
                    @Param("expectedStatus") EventConsumeStatus expectedStatus,
                    @Param("newStatus") EventConsumeStatus newStatus);
```

```java
// EventRetryTask.java 修复后的 retry() 方法
@Scheduled(fixedRateString = "${spring.whale.event.retryScheduleInterval:60000}")
public void retry() {
    Page<EventConsumeFailedRecordEntity> page = recordRepository
        .findByStatusAndNextRetryTimeBefore(
            EventConsumeStatus.PENDING_RETRY, LocalDateTime.now(),
            PageRequest.of(0, eventProperties.getRetryBatchSize()));

    if (!page.hasContent()) return;

    for (EventConsumeFailedRecordEntity entity : page.getContent()) {
        // CAS: 先改状态为 RETRYING，只有成功抢占的实例才发送
        int updated = recordRepository.casUpdateStatus(
            entity.getMessageId(),
            EventConsumeStatus.PENDING_RETRY,
            EventConsumeStatus.RETRYING
        );
        if (updated == 0) {
            continue; // 被其他实例抢占了
        }
        try {
            EventMessage eventMessage = buildEventMessage(entity);
            eventPublisher.publish(eventMessage);
        } catch (Exception e) {
            log.error("Retry publish failed for messageId={}", entity.getMessageId(), e);
            // 回滚状态到 PENDING_RETRY，等待下次重试
            recordRepository.casUpdateStatus(
                entity.getMessageId(),
                EventConsumeStatus.RETRYING,
                EventConsumeStatus.PENDING_RETRY
            );
        }
    }
}
```

